WEBVTT

NOTE
English George narration, Eleven v4, web Generation 2.
Instrumental music continues under the narration.
The roles film uses its own narration timings.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.300
[Instrumental music]

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.798
Four roles. Clear permissions.

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:08.607
Administrators manage the workspace, prepare, approve and read reports.

00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:14.797
Supervisors prepare. Approval and reports: independent, off by default.

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:20.529
Operators import documents and prepare dispatches. They cannot approve them.

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:26.797
Observers read documents, recipients and status. No edits or approvals.

00:00:27.200 --> 00:00:30.737
Standard flow: human approval in your browser.

00:00:30.737 --> 00:00:31.000
[The instrumental music softens.]

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:35.100
[A final chord resonates, without percussion.]

00:00:35.100 --> 00:00:36.000
[The music gently fades away.]
